@startuml
actor User
boundary "views/declares/edit.html.erb" as View
control "DeclaresController" as Controller
entity "Declare Model" as Model
database "Database" as DB

User -> View: Edit declare form and submit
View -> Controller: Send PATCH/PUT /declares/:id request
Controller -> Model: Find declare by ID
Model -> DB: Query declare by ID
DB --> Model: Return declare object
Model -> Model: Update declare attributes
Model -> DB: Save updated declare
DB --> Model: Return success/failure
Model --> Controller: Return updated declare object
Controller -> View: Redirect to declares show page
View -> User: Display updated declare
@enduml
